    "detailed_description": "<strong>Deep desktop facilitates the usage of the latest monocular depth estimation algorithms to use them on the content of your screen:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>NEW: Use it also with your video files with the new video player!</strong><br></li><li> Automatically install all the requirements for the algorithms to work and avoid a tedious installation process.<br></li><li> Run in real time with the content of your screen, no need to go through annoying VR prompts or file explorers to access your content.<br></li><li> Move into the scene displayed with the movements button.<br></li><li> Allow you to use a second GPU to ease the burden on the one used for the VR headset.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Deep desktop facilitates the usage of the latest monocular depth estimation algorithms to use them on the content of your screen:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>NEW: Use it also with your video files with the new video player!</strong><br></li><li> Automatically install all the requirements for the algorithms to work and avoid a tedious installation process.<br></li><li> Run in real time with the content of your screen, no need to go through annoying VR prompts or file explorers to access your content.<br></li><li> Move into the scene displayed with the movements button.<br></li><li> Allow you to use a second GPU to ease the burden on the one used for the VR headset.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Deep Desktop creates a copy of your screen in VR with a 3D depth effect added to any content (Pictures, Video, Games) that is displayed!",
